Error [E0121]: `optional` was consumed by the pattern match, so it can't be used here
  --> mutable_view_extraction_retires_the_source_aggregate_2.jet:10:15
    |
 10 |         print(optional)
    |               ^^^^^^^^
  --> mutable_view_extraction_retires_the_source_aggregate_2.jet:9:8
    |
  9 |     if optional == Val(selected) {
    |        ^^^^^^^^ `optional` moved to the pattern match here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `optional` after the move, or give the pattern match a copy with `~optional` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
